WEBVTT

00:09.172 --> 00:10.517
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.586 --> 00:12.137
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.206 --> 00:13.655
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.724 --> 00:15.758
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.827 --> 00:18.758
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:18.827 --> 00:20.793
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.862 --> 00:22.862
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:22.931 --> 00:24.689
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.758 --> 00:26.620
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:26.689 --> 00:28.827
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:28.896 --> 00:30.793
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:30.862 --> 00:32.793
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.862 --> 00:34.793
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:34.862 --> 00:36.586
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:36.655 --> 00:38.896
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.965 --> 00:40.827
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.896 --> 00:42.137
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:42.206 --> 00:44.000
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:44.068 --> 00:46.724
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.793 --> 00:49.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:49.103 --> 00:50.586
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:52.413 --> 00:55.310
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:55.379 --> 01:01.793
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:04.724 --> 01:07.448
- Where's that order
for table three?
- 订单在哪里
对于表三？

01:07.517 --> 01:09.551
Table five's
ready to be bussed!
表五
准备好乘坐巴士了！

01:09.620 --> 01:11.620
There's a spill in
the bathroom!
里面有溢出物
浴室！

01:11.689 --> 01:14.517
I need ya swabbing the decks,
Mr. Squidward!
我需要你擦拭甲板，
章鱼哥先生！

01:14.586 --> 01:16.586
Hmm?
SpongeBob!
唔？
海绵宝宝！

01:16.655 --> 01:18.413
Table eight needs more
coral fries!
表八需要更多
珊瑚薯条！

01:18.482 --> 01:19.724
Hop to it, boy!
跳起来吧，孩子！

01:19.793 --> 01:22.137
- [panting]
Hopping, sir!
- [气喘吁吁]
跳跃吧，先生！

01:24.068 --> 01:26.620
- My thirst is
not yet quenched!
- 我的口渴是
还没有熄灭！

01:26.689 --> 01:28.413
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:28.482 --> 01:30.275
- Ha!
[grunts]
- 哈！
[咕哝]

01:30.344 --> 01:31.931
Here you go!
Thank you!
干得好！
谢谢你！

01:32.000 --> 01:33.379
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

01:33.448 --> 01:36.137
No free refills!
Ha!
没有免费补充！
哈!

01:36.206 --> 01:39.448
- [grunts]
I'm out of ketchup!
- [咕哝]
我的番茄酱用完了！

01:39.517 --> 01:41.448
- We need utensils!
- [moaning]
- 我们需要餐具！
- [呻吟]

01:41.517 --> 01:43.827
[car horn honks]
- I ordered this to go!
[汽车喇叭鸣响]
- 我命令这个走！

01:43.896 --> 01:45.793
- [grunts]
Whoo-hoo!
- [咕哝]
呼呼！

01:45.862 --> 01:47.172
Oh, ho!
哦，嗬！

01:47.241 --> 01:49.137
all: Arrgh!
全体：啊啊！

01:49.206 --> 01:51.896
- Hey!
Ah, ha-ha!
- 嘿！
啊哈哈！

01:51.965 --> 01:53.000
You won't be pilferin'
你不会偷窃

01:53.068 --> 01:55.724
me precious profits today,
pirates!
今天我获得了宝贵的利润，
海盗！

01:55.793 --> 01:58.103
[all grunt]
[全都咕哝]

01:58.172 --> 02:00.551
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

02:00.620 --> 02:03.034
- Aww.
- 哇。

02:03.103 --> 02:04.275
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

02:04.344 --> 02:07.137
- [babbles]
- [胡言乱语]

02:07.206 --> 02:09.034
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:09.103 --> 02:11.862
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

02:11.931 --> 02:13.931
Phew!
唷！

02:15.586 --> 02:19.689
Yep, takes a pretty steady claw
to oversee this ship.
是的，需要一个相当稳定的爪子
来监督这艘船。

02:19.758 --> 02:21.034
[chuckles]
[笑声]

02:21.103 --> 02:22.482
[barks, sniffs]
[吠叫，嗅嗅]

02:22.551 --> 02:24.068
What is it, girl?
What do you smell?
这是什么，女孩？
你闻到什么味道了？

02:24.137 --> 02:25.896
Whoa!
[claw barks]
哇！
[爪声]

02:25.965 --> 02:28.379
- Ooh!
- 哦！

02:28.448 --> 02:30.413
Find a penny.
Pick it up.
找一分钱。
捡起来。

02:30.482 --> 02:33.000
All day long
you'll have a penny!
一整天
你会得到一分钱！

02:33.068 --> 02:35.000
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

02:35.068 --> 02:37.000
What a good girl!
多么好的一个女孩啊！

02:37.068 --> 02:38.931
- Order up!
- 订购吧！

02:39.000 --> 02:42.827
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

02:42.896 --> 02:46.724
[yells]
[喊叫]

02:46.793 --> 02:48.655
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:48.724 --> 02:51.827
- Hey, a penny!
- 嘿，一分钱！

02:51.896 --> 02:54.655
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

02:54.724 --> 02:56.793
[siren blares]
[警笛声]

02:56.862 --> 02:59.344
- Ah!
Somebody call an ambulance!
- 啊！
有人叫救护车吗！

02:59.413 --> 03:01.103
Oh, you're here.
哦，你来了。

03:01.172 --> 03:02.620
Wait, Mr. Krabs!
等等，蟹老板！

03:02.689 --> 03:04.586
Who's in charge
while you're out?
谁负责
当你出去的时候？

03:04.655 --> 03:06.965
- [gibberish]
- Yes?
- [胡言乱语]
- 是吗？

03:07.034 --> 03:10.275
- [groans]
- Yes?
- [呻吟]
- 是吗？

03:10.344 --> 03:12.137
Yeah?
Yes?
是的？
是的？

03:12.206 --> 03:14.724
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:14.793 --> 03:17.379
[SpongeBob
and Squidward groan]
[海绵宝宝
和章鱼哥的呻吟]

03:17.448 --> 03:20.137
- [weakly] Not SpongeBob.
- Let's go.
- [弱弱地] 不是海绵宝宝。
- 我们走吧。

03:20.206 --> 03:22.482
- No! No!
- Ooh, he picked me!
- 不！不！
- 哦，他选了我！

03:22.551 --> 03:24.620
I--I'm in charge!
我——我负责！

03:24.689 --> 03:26.379
Don't worry, Mr. Krabs,
别担心，蟹老板，

03:26.448 --> 03:28.862
I'll be the best boss
the Krusty Krab ever had!
我会成为最好的老板
蟹堡王曾经吃过！

03:28.931 --> 03:31.586
Just like you, Mr. Krabs!
就像你一样，蟹老板！

03:31.655 --> 03:34.551
- Ha!
You can't do Krabs's job!
- 哈！
你不能做蟹老板的工作！

03:34.620 --> 03:36.413
- [sniffs]
Oh, I can't?
- [嗅嗅]
哦，我不能吗？

03:36.482 --> 03:37.827
- Of course not!
- 当然不是！

03:37.896 --> 03:39.724
You're going to get some
annoying idea in your head,
你会得到一些
你脑子里烦人的想法

03:39.793 --> 03:41.965
act all silly,
and ruin everything!
表现得很愚蠢，
并毁掉一切！

03:42.034 --> 03:44.517
Like you always do.
就像你平常做的那样。

03:44.586 --> 03:48.758
- Well, I guess if
I wanna boss like Mr. Krabs...
- 好吧，我想如果
我想要像蟹老板那样的老板...

03:48.827 --> 03:50.689
I'll have to think like Krabs!
我得像蟹蟹一样思考！

03:50.758 --> 03:53.137
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

03:53.206 --> 03:56.896
- [groaning]
- [humming]
- [呻吟]
- [嗡嗡声]

03:58.379 --> 04:02.103
- Mr. Krabs,
I'm so glad you're back!
- 蟹老板先生，
我很高兴你回来了！

04:02.172 --> 04:05.413
Ah!
- [whines]
啊!
- [哀嚎]

04:05.482 --> 04:07.413
- Ooh, just wait till you see
- 哦，等你看到

04:07.482 --> 04:10.137
what I've done
to your restaurant!
我做了什么
到你的餐厅！

04:10.206 --> 04:12.000
- [muffled cries]
- [低沉的哭声]

04:12.068 --> 04:14.034
- Oh!
- 哦！

04:14.103 --> 04:16.344
- Nothing!
Isn't it great?
- 没有什么！
不是很好吗？

04:16.413 --> 04:18.896
Everything's just how
you left it!
一切都不过如此
你离开了！

04:18.965 --> 04:21.413
Whenever we have a problem
around here, I ask myself,
每当我们遇到问题时
在这里，我问自己，

04:21.482 --> 04:24.068
"What would Mr. Krabs do?"
And then I do that!
“蟹老板会怎么做？”
然后我就这么做了！

04:25.413 --> 04:27.655
I even hired a new fry cook,
我什至雇了一个新的炒菜厨师

04:27.724 --> 04:29.758
since I'm too busy being
the boss now.
因为我太忙了
现在的老板。

04:29.827 --> 04:32.206
Just like you would have done!
就像你会做的那样！

04:32.275 --> 04:35.034
- [muffled] No, no!
No, no, no, no, no, no, no!
- [低声] 不，不！
不，不，不，不，不，不，不！

04:35.103 --> 04:38.413
- Hmm, hmm, hmm.
- 嗯，嗯，嗯。

04:39.689 --> 04:42.517
- Don't worry, I taught him
everything I know!
- 别担心，我教过他
我所知道的一切！

04:44.241 --> 04:46.793
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

04:49.827 --> 04:51.275
[laughs]
[笑]

04:51.344 --> 04:53.931
- [hums]
- [哼哼]

04:55.344 --> 04:57.862
- Order's up!
- 订单已到！

04:57.931 --> 04:59.586
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

04:59.655 --> 05:01.000
- You'll have a better view
- 你会有更好的视野

05:01.068 --> 05:04.000
of my managerial magic
from over here.
我的管理魔法
从这里。

05:04.068 --> 05:06.655
- I'm out of napkins!
- 我的餐巾纸用完了！

05:06.724 --> 05:09.655
- Ooh, Here we go!
Watch me work!
- 哦，我们开始了！
看我干活！

05:09.724 --> 05:12.103
Your napkin, sir!
先生，您的餐巾纸！

05:12.172 --> 05:13.586
- Thank you!
- 谢谢你！

05:13.655 --> 05:15.965
- Hey!
This table is too wobbly!
- 嘿！
这桌子也太晃了吧！

05:16.034 --> 05:17.586
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

05:17.655 --> 05:20.758
- Well, let the boss
take care of that, huh?
- 好吧，让老板
照顾好这个吧？

05:20.827 --> 05:22.517
Ta-da!
- [groans]
哒哒！
- [呻吟]

05:22.586 --> 05:24.689
- Ooh!
Nice.
- 哦！
好的。

05:24.758 --> 05:27.517
- [hums]
- Ahem.
- [哼哼]
- 咳咳。

05:27.586 --> 05:29.827
- What do you want?
- 你想要什么？

05:29.896 --> 05:32.965
- Squidward!
What would Mr. Krabs say?
- 章鱼哥！
蟹老板会说什么？

05:33.034 --> 05:35.172
At the Krusty Krab,
Mr. Squidward,
在蟹堡王店里，
章鱼哥先生，

05:35.241 --> 05:38.379
we're always polite
to our payin' customers!"
我们总是很有礼貌
给我们的付费客户！”

05:38.448 --> 05:42.896
- Welcome to the Krusty Krab.
May I please take your order?
- 欢迎来到蟹堡王。
我可以接受您的订单吗？

05:42.965 --> 05:46.620
- Remember, Squidward,
service with a smile!
- 记住，章鱼哥，
微笑服务！

05:46.689 --> 05:49.862
Here, try one of Mr. Krabs's
vintage training devices!
来，尝尝蟹老板的一份
老式训练设备！

05:49.931 --> 05:51.827
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

05:51.896 --> 05:55.586
[moans]
[呻吟声]

05:55.655 --> 05:59.862
May I please take your order?
我可以接受您的订单吗？

05:59.931 --> 06:03.517
- Oh, uh,
I'll take a Krabby Patty.
- 哦，呃，
我要一份蟹肉饼。

06:03.586 --> 06:05.862
Hold the freaky smile!
[nervous chuckle]
保持诡异的微笑！
[紧张的笑声]

06:05.931 --> 06:08.724
- [moans]
- [呻吟]

06:08.793 --> 06:13.379
- I think that went
pretty well, don't you?
- 我想就这样了
很好，不是吗？

06:13.448 --> 06:15.172
[yells]
[喊叫]

06:15.241 --> 06:19.000
- SpongeBob, you aggravating,
obnoxious, loathsome little--
- 海绵宝宝，你真烦人，
讨厌的、可恶的小——

06:19.068 --> 06:20.379
[saw buzzing]
[看到嗡嗡声]

06:20.448 --> 06:22.482
- Um, hold that constructive
criticism, Squidward.
- 嗯，保持建设性的态度
批评，章鱼哥。

06:22.551 --> 06:24.689
I'll be right back!
我马上回来！

06:24.758 --> 06:27.034
Patrick, what are you doing?
帕特里克，你在做什么？

06:27.103 --> 06:29.758
- Huh?
I'm cleaning the deli slicer.
- 啊？
我正在清洁熟食切片机。

06:29.827 --> 06:32.482
I used the tongs like you said.
我按照你说的用了钳子。

06:34.379 --> 06:36.448
- Ah, ah, ah!
- 啊啊啊！

06:36.517 --> 06:39.172
"The tongs are for
holding rags, not bricks!"
“钳子是为了
拿的是破布，不是砖头！”

06:39.241 --> 06:41.862
Let me finish this, pal.
You get back on the grill.
让我完成这个，朋友。
你回到烤架上。

06:41.931 --> 06:44.413
- Okeydoke.
- [yells]
- 奥基多克。
- [大喊]

06:44.482 --> 06:45.655
- What the...
- 什么...

06:45.724 --> 06:49.551
- [yells, groans]
- [喊叫，呻吟]

06:49.620 --> 06:53.000
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

06:55.241 --> 06:56.827
- Hey, um, Patrick?
- 嘿，嗯，帕特里克？

06:56.896 --> 06:58.586
Could you, uh,
bump the grill temperature up
你能不能，呃，
提高烤架温度

06:58.655 --> 07:00.551
about half a degree?
大约半度？

07:00.620 --> 07:03.586
- Fine.
- 美好的。

07:03.655 --> 07:05.137
- And you should be
flipping the patties
- 你应该是
翻转肉饼

07:05.206 --> 07:07.655
with a clockwise
wrist motion because
以顺时针方向
手腕运动是因为

07:07.724 --> 07:09.931
the customers can always
taste the difference!
客户总是可以
尝尝差别！

07:10.000 --> 07:15.206
- [moans]
Whatever you say, boss.
- [呻吟]
老板你说什么都行。

07:15.275 --> 07:18.586
[babbles]
[胡言乱语]

07:18.655 --> 07:21.310
[chuckles]
[笑声]

07:21.379 --> 07:22.724
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

07:22.793 --> 07:26.034
No, Patrick!
We went over this!
不，帕特里克！
我们讨论过这个！

07:26.103 --> 07:28.275
It goes bun, patty,
cheese, pickles,
它变成了面包，肉饼，
奶酪、泡菜、

07:28.344 --> 07:29.586
lettuce, tomatoes, bun!
生菜，西红柿，面包！

07:29.655 --> 07:30.827
Not bun, patty,
cheese, lettuce,
不是馒头、肉饼，
奶酪、生菜、

07:30.896 --> 07:32.965
pickles, tomatoes, bun!
泡菜，西红柿，面包！

07:33.034 --> 07:34.586
- That's it!
- 就是这样！

07:34.655 --> 07:36.000
This was supposed to be fun,
这本来应该很有趣

07:36.068 --> 07:39.241
but now it's, uh,
the other thing!
但现在是，呃，
另一件事！

07:39.310 --> 07:41.275
I quit!
[gulp]
我不干了！
[吞咽]

07:42.655 --> 07:44.310
These too!
还有这些！

07:44.379 --> 07:46.413
- But Patrick,
you're my best friend-ployee!
- 但是帕特里克，
你是我最好的朋友-员工！

07:46.482 --> 07:49.379
[rapid groaning]
[快速呻吟]

07:49.448 --> 07:51.689
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

07:56.275 --> 07:57.793
Shpoink!
Wow!
嘘！
哇！

07:57.862 --> 08:00.137
Aren't you a real slice off
the ol' block!
你不是一个真正的切片吗
老街区！

08:00.206 --> 08:02.034
Can you work the grill?
- Ah! Mm-hmm!
你能操作烤架吗？
- 啊！嗯嗯！

08:02.103 --> 08:04.000
- [laughs]
You're hired.
- [笑]
你被录用了。

08:06.482 --> 08:08.206
Ahh.
啊。

08:08.275 --> 08:11.068
[crowd clamoring]
[人群喧闹]

08:11.137 --> 08:14.310
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:15.137 --> 08:17.344
- Mr. Squidward,
it's not time for your break!
- 章鱼哥先生
现在还不是你休息的时间！

08:17.413 --> 08:21.310
- I'm taking a permanent break
from you!
- 我要永久休息
来自你！

08:21.379 --> 08:24.344
I quit!
我不干了！

08:24.413 --> 08:26.620
[grumbles]
[抱怨]

08:26.689 --> 08:29.551
- No!
[whimpers]
- 不！
[呜咽]

08:29.620 --> 08:32.689
Oh, uh-oh!
I need more employees!
哦，呃-哦！
我需要更多员工！

08:32.758 --> 08:36.344
Ooh!
Uh, just a second everybody!
哦！
呃，大家稍等一下！

08:36.413 --> 08:38.793
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:42.758 --> 08:45.103
[crowd clamoring]
[人群喧闹]

08:46.586 --> 08:48.517
